{"sha": "ab10ff7cdde4fe37bc95862b27e162f7fa14823b11a216f2738fd9e811b3a163", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=2.2]", "  \\draw[->] (-0.25,0) -- (1.5,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-0.25) -- (0,1.45) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\fill[omDef!20] (0,0) -- (1,0) -- (50:1) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[gray, thin] (-10:1) arc (-10:80:1);", "  \\draw[omProp, thick] (0,0) -- (1,0) -- (1,1.1918) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omDef] (0,0) -- (1,0) -- (50:1) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (1,0) arc (0:50:1);", "  \\draw[dashed] (50:1) -- (0.643,0);", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0.68,0.35) {$\\sin t$};", "  \\node[omProp, right, font=\\small] at (1,0.62) {$\\tan t$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (20:0.5) {$t$};", "  \\fill (50:1) circle (0.6pt);", "  \\node at (58:1.22) {$M(t)$};", "  \\fill (1,0) circle (0.6pt) node[below right] {$I$};", "  \\node[below left] at (0,0) {$O$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三个嵌套的区域：三角形 $OIM$（蓝色，面积", "$\\frac{\\sin t}{2}$）、扇形（红色弧线所界，面积", "$\\frac{t}{2}$）以及高为 $\\tan t$ 的直角三角形（橙色，面积", "$\\frac{\\tan t}{2}$）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "由第一个不等式得 $\\frac{\\sin t}{t} \\leq 1$；由第二个得", "$\\cos t \\leq \\frac{\\sin t}{t}$。当 $t \\to 0^+$ 时，由连续性 $\\cos t \\to 1$，", "由夹逼定理得 $\\frac{\\sin t}{t} \\to 1$，利用奇偶性，", "可得 $t \\to 0$ 时的结论。对第二个极限，", "\\[", "\\frac{\\cos t - 1}{t} = \\frac{\\cos^2 t - 1}{t(\\cos t + 1)}", "= -\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\cdot\\frac{\\sin t}{\\cos t + 1}", "\\xrightarrow[t\\to0]{} -1 \\cdot \\frac{0}{2} = 0. \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[正弦与余弦的导数]\\label{thm:g12:trigo:derivatives}", "函数 $\\sin$ 与 $\\cos$ 在 $\\R$ 上可导，且", "\\[", "(\\sin)' = \\cos, \\qquad (\\cos)' = -\\sin .", "\\]", "一般地，$(\\sin(ax+b))' = a\\cos(ax+b)$，", "$(\\cos(ax+b))' = -a\\sin(ax+b)$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由和角公式，", "\\[", "\\frac{\\sin(x+h) - \\sin x}{h}", "= \\sin x\\,\\frac{\\cos h - 1}{h} + \\cos x\\,\\frac{\\sin h}{h}", "\\xrightarrow[h\\to0]{} \\sin x \\cdot 0 + \\cos x \\cdot 1 = \\cos x,", "\\]", "利用\\cref{lem:g12:trigo:sinxx}。$\\cos$ 的计算完全类似，", "一般形式由链式法则得到。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[单调性]\\label{prop:g12:trigo:variations}", "在 $\\intcc{0}{\\pi}$ 上，$\\cos$ 从 $1$ 递减到 $-1$；", "在 $\\intcc{-\\frac\\pi2}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 上，$\\sin$ 从 $-1$ 递增到 $1$。两个", "函数都是 $2\\pi$ 周期的，值域均为 $\\intcc{-1}{1}$；$\\cos$ 是", "偶函数，$\\sin$ 是奇函数。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在 $\\intoo{0}{\\pi}$ 上，$(\\cos)' = -\\sin < 0$，因为点 $M(t)$ 在此处", "的纵坐标为正；同理 $(\\sin)' = \\cos > 0$ 在", "$\\intoo{-\\frac\\pi2}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 上成立。周期性与奇偶性由", "\\cref{prop:g12:trigo:identities}可得。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=12cm, height=4.5cm,", "  axis lines=middle,", "  xmin=-7, xmax=7, ymin=-1.4, ymax=1.4,", "  xtick={-6.2832,-3.1416,3.1416,6.2832},", "  xticklabels={$-2\\pi$,$-\\pi$,$\\pi$,$2\\pi$},", "  ytick={-1,1},", "  samples=200, domain=-7:7]", "  \\addplot[omDef,thick] {cos(deg(x))};", "  \\addplot[omThm,thick] {sin(deg(x))};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $\\cos$ 的图像（蓝色）与 $\\sin$ 的图像（红色）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[解方程 $\\cos x = a$ 与 $\\sin x = a$]\\label{met:g12:trigo:equations}", "对 $a \\in \\intcc{-1}{1}$，求出一个特解 $\\alpha$（可由三角函数表或", "计算器得到）。则全部解为：", "\\[", "\\cos x = \\cos\\alpha \\iff x = \\alpha + 2k\\pi \\text{ 或 } x = -\\alpha + 2k\\pi,", "\\quad k \\in \\Z;", "\\]", "\\[", "\\sin x = \\sin\\alpha \\iff x = \\alpha + 2k\\pi \\text{ 或 } x = \\pi - \\alpha + 2k\\pi,", "\\quad k \\in \\Z.", "\\]", "解不等式时，在单位圆上找出解所在的弧，", "并在一个周期内读出相应区间。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g12:trigo:equation}", "求方程 $\\cos x = \\frac12$ 在 $\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 内的解：", "一个特解为 $\\frac\\pi3$，故解为 $x = \\frac\\pi3$ 与 $x = -\\frac\\pi3$。", "在 $\\R$ 上全部解为：$x = \\pm\\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$，$k \\in \\Z$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", ""]}